  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "3f5b7b94-e918-44cf-b2d4-d8b2c2a9aa8d"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "one construction encapsulated as a step of a scene; a second argument \
labels it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"023b1949-1e9f-4f94-b9ae-a2d585ff6c7c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
